&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"text-gray-700"</span>&gt;</span>You can at any time change or withdraw your consent from the Cookie Declaration on our website.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>
