I hope I don’t forget anything! Of course I’m not, why I’m I sure? Because I tried a lot of variants. Thinking about how I can put it in APP_INITIALIZER and bind component to div. But it is not a good idea. We’ll need to call the service in AppComponent. Logic will be so simple:&nbsp;
export class AppComponent {
&nbsp;&nbsp;cookieConsentService = inject(CookieConsentService);
&nbsp;&nbsp;viewContainerRef = inject(ViewContainerRef);
&nbsp;&nbsp;constructor() {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;this.cookieConsentService.showCookieConsent(this.viewContainerRef);
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
}
</code></pre><div></div><div><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">Let''s run this s…, this shining piece of code!</span></div><div class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;"><img src="https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfTIKn4-nAuigJe4daE65SD9JGnYi6Zz2p0tsbF4IfgRxI5DnUuUyqWlDQlHDK0pnLojH98tZmbV2F5gIh7clRlEO1iH-3p0bO2BIc3Mubwq9I0XR5xmNu1yjS2DmJLBX4OzcjJkRPGjn8NzGD69YPY3tHv?key=OvAySdI6JkikXf7BwYIHUQ" height="176" width="424"></span></div><div></div><div class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;"><img src="https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfyKMsIMX-mDiH0VacnqOWOcUFuErbW48O7yuYxvcgNdFZq07OtXJJ7WGC7fATmLYFD5Ln_hnX8teoxl8dqnXGHeetj0hXbLUuId0cpB48MDg1jHsBq7nzCAA5ZwD3LppwRiqpEAINKKecCXE7J66Uv5Lg?key=OvAySdI6JkikXf7BwYIHUQ" height="779" width="602"></span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">Oh, no compiler police caught us. But don’t worry, my father is a lawyer.</span></div><div></div><div><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">This error appears because the </span><strong style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">LocalStorage</strong><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;"> doesn’t exist on the server side. So when </span><strong style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">SSG </strong><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">kicked in, problems started. </span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">What we can do?&nbsp;</span></div><div><u style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent;"><a href="https://angular.dev/api/core/afterNextRender" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Angular provided to two methods working only on the </a></u><u style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://angular.dev/api/core/afterNextRender" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">browser platform</a></u><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">:</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">afterRender</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">afterNextRender</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">They basically are created to catch DOM elements. But they are working perfectly for this purpose. </span><strong style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">AfterRender</strong><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;"> runs every render. </span><strong style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">AfterNextRender </strong><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">runs only once after initial, server side rendering.</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">Little fix:</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">AppComponent</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;cookieConsentService = <span class="hljs-title function_">inject</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">CookieConsentService</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;viewContainerRef = <span class="hljs-title function_">inject</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">ViewContainerRef</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">constructor</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">afterNextRender</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">cookieConsentService</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">showCookieConsent</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">viewContainerRef</span>));
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
}
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">Remember that these methods need to be invoked in the constructor.</span></div><div></div><h2 class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">End of part 2</span></h2><div><span style="color: rgb(14, 14, 14); background-color: transparent;">Thank you for being here with me again. Three tasks have been thrown away from this sprint and we still have 22 A4 pages. I still have a lot of work to do. I’m waiting for Angular 18.1, there will be a method for building routes.txt from Angular itself. I just wasted(spent) 8h to build it on the server side. I have a lot of fun coding this blog, hope you do too.&nbsp;</span></div><div></div><div></div>', false, '2024-07-09T18:46:10+00:00', 'https://aqdbdmepncxxuanlymwr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/covers/ChatGPT%20Image%2011%20sie%202026,%2020_53_29.png', '[]'::jsonb),
  ('86a90108-f845-4879-8c88-17653e4b39fb', 'a3b3cf93-6956-41c7-bec0-13f95dd42f26', 'Honey on my eyes! - super efficient blog app Part 3', 'In Part 3, we focus on admin features, editor improvements, and unsaved data protection. We switched from p-editor to Quill, overcoming issues with highlight.js and server-side rendering. Now, syntax highlighting works smoothly.  To prevent data loss, we added a before-unload warning and a CanDeactivate guard, prompting users before leaving unsaved work. A new "Save as Draft" feature lets posts be stored without publishing.  Editing posts is now seamless with automatic form population when modifying an existing post. We also fixed heading styles in Tailwind and formatted dates properly from Firebase timestamps.  Finally, we extended Quill to support TypeScript syntax highlighting. Another step toward making this blog app powerful and efficient! 🚀 Stay tuned for more!', '<div></div><div></div><div></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Pre: So we going to move forward, to be sure we are on same page, here is a Part-2 branch:</span></div><div><u style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent;"><a href="https://github.com/Lukecsharpwalker/angularBlogPublic/tree/Part--2" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">https://github.com/Lukecsharpwalker/angularBlogPublic/tree/Part--2</a></u></div><div class="ql-align-center"><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Part 3: Assumptions</strong></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">In this part, we will focus mostly on the Admin side. I plan to tweak the editor a little bit, and improve some functionalities. Now I’m writing text in Google Docs because I can mistakenly close widows and I’ll lose everything xD.</span></div><div class="ql-align-center"></div><div class="ql-align-center"></div><h1 class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">From p-editor to (hell) Quill</span></h1><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Basically all frameworks, libraries, etc. are created to help us develop code faster. Get rid of boilerplate.</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">I tried to add </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">highlight.js</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> to primeNG - p-editor, but I haven’t found solution. Also, I tried to use </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">ngx-quill </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;in version </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">26.0.5 </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">and faced a lot of issues, including two main ones:</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Error: Syntax module requires highlight.js. Please include the library on the page before Quill,</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">second is about the not-defined </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">document</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> on the server side.</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Second sounds easy! Just use </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">AfterNextRender()</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> and that’s it, yeah…</span></div><div class="ql-align-center"><img src="data:image/png;base64,"></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">My idea was to dive in as deep as I need, to understand these issues.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">What I know for now:</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">If you use </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">ngx-quill, &lt;quill-editor&gt; </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;- need to be wrapped in </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">@defer</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">,</span></div><div><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Quill Module</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> and </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Block Module </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">need to be imported dynamically, on demand,</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">If you are using </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">highlight.js </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">it should be attached to the </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">window</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">,</span></div><div><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Highlight </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">styles looks different on </span><u style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent;"><a href="https://highlightjs.org/demo" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Highlight demo</a></u><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> than in Quill and hard to find good style for HTML, Better use Java for HTML XD&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">I’m still sometimes having issues with loading </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Quill</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">. The fix is to refresh the page. I can live without it, but not for long 😀.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">We need to update </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">app.config.ts</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">, add </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">provideHighlightOptions</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> and </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">provideQuillConfig</strong></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> <span class="hljs-attr">appConfig</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">ApplicationConfig</span> = {
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">providers</span>: [
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">provideHttpClient</span>(<span class="hljs-title function_">withFetch</span>()),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">provideZoneChangeDetection</span>({ <span class="hljs-attr">eventCoalescing</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">true</span> }),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">provideRouter</span>(routes, <span class="hljs-title function_">withComponentInputBinding</span>()),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">provideClientHydration</span>(<span class="hljs-title function_">withEventReplay</span>()),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">provideFirebaseApp</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">initializeApp</span>(environment.<span class="hljs-property">firebase</span>)),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">provideAuth</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">getAuth</span>()),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">provideFirestore</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">getFirestore</span>()),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">provideFunctions</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">getFunctions</span>()),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">provideStorage</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">getStorage</span>()),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">provide</span>: <span class="hljs-variable constant_">APP_INITIALIZER</span>,
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">useFactory</span>: authInnitializer,
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">deps</span>: [<span class="hljs-title class_">AuthService</span>],
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">multi</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>,
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;},
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">provideHighlightOptions</span>({
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">coreLibraryLoader</span>: <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''highlight.js/lib/core''</span>),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">languages</span>: {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">xml</span>: <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''highlight.js/lib/languages/xml''</span>),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">typescript</span>: <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''highlight.js/lib/languages/typescript''</span>),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">javascript</span>: <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''highlight.js/lib/languages/javascript''</span>),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">css</span>: <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''highlight.js/lib/languages/css''</span>),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">java</span>: <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''highlight.js/lib/languages/java''</span>),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;},
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">provideQuillConfig</span>({
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">modules</span>: {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">syntax</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>,
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">toolbar</span>: quillToolbarConfig
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}),
&nbsp;&nbsp;]
};
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">I moved configuration to </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">shared/utils</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { <span class="hljs-title class_">HighlightLoader</span> } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">''ngx-highlightjs''</span>;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Block</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">''quill/blots/block''</span>;
</code></pre><div></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">async</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">loadQuillModules</span>(<span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-attr">hljsLoader</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">HighlightLoader</span></span>): <span class="hljs-title class_">Promise</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-built_in">void</span>&gt; {
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> [<span class="hljs-title class_">QuillModule</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">BlocKModule</span>] = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Promise</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">all</span>([
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''quill''</span>), <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''quill/blots/block''</span>)
&nbsp;&nbsp;]);
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title class_">BlocKModule</span>.<span class="hljs-property">default</span>.<span class="hljs-property">tagName</span> = <span class="hljs-string">"DIV"</span>;
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title class_">QuillModule</span>.<span class="hljs-property">default</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">register</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">Block</span>, <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>);
}
<span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> quillToolbarConfig = [
&nbsp;&nbsp;[<span class="hljs-string">''bold''</span>, <span class="hljs-string">''italic''</span>, <span class="hljs-string">''underline''</span>, <span class="hljs-string">''strike''</span>]toggled buttons
&nbsp;&nbsp;[<span class="hljs-string">''blockquote''</span>, <span class="hljs-string">''code-block''</span>],
&nbsp;&nbsp;[<span class="hljs-string">''link''</span>, <span class="hljs-string">''image''</span>, <span class="hljs-string">''video''</span>, <span class="hljs-string">''formula''</span>]
&nbsp;&nbsp;[{ <span class="hljs-string">''header''</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1</span> }, { <span class="hljs-string">''header''</span>: <span class="hljs-number">2</span> }],&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-comment">// custom button values</span>
&nbsp;&nbsp;[{ <span class="hljs-string">''list''</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''ordered''</span> }, { <span class="hljs-string">''list''</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''bullet''</span> }, { <span class="hljs-string">''list''</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''check''</span> }],
&nbsp;&nbsp;[{ <span class="hljs-string">''script''</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''sub''</span> }, { <span class="hljs-string">''script''</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''super''</span> }],&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-comment">// superscript/subscript</span>
&nbsp;&nbsp;[{ <span class="hljs-string">''indent''</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''-1''</span> }, { <span class="hljs-string">''indent''</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''+1''</span> }],&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-comment">// outdent/indent</span>
&nbsp;&nbsp;[{ <span class="hljs-string">''direction''</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''rtl''</span> }],&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-comment">// text direction</span>
&nbsp;&nbsp;[{ <span class="hljs-string">''size''</span>: [<span class="hljs-string">''small''</span>, <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>, <span class="hljs-string">''large''</span>, <span class="hljs-string">''huge''</span>] }],&nbsp;<span class="hljs-comment">// custom dropdown</span>
&nbsp;&nbsp;[{ <span class="hljs-string">''header''</span>: [<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-number">2</span>, <span class="hljs-number">3</span>, <span class="hljs-number">4</span>, <span class="hljs-number">5</span>, <span class="hljs-number">6</span>, <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>] }],
&nbsp;&nbsp;[{ <span class="hljs-string">''color''</span>: [] }, { <span class="hljs-string">''background''</span>: [] }]dropdown <span class="hljs-keyword">with</span> defaults <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> theme
&nbsp;&nbsp;[{ <span class="hljs-string">''font''</span>: [] }],
&nbsp;&nbsp;[{ <span class="hljs-string">''align''</span>: [] }],
&nbsp;&nbsp;[<span class="hljs-string">''clean''</span>]&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-comment">// remove formatting button</span>
]
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">and </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">HTML</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">:</span></div><pre data-language="xml"><code class="xml">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">quill-editor</span> <span class="hljs-attr">formControlName</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"content"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"h-screen"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">quill-editor</span>&gt;</span>
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">OK, everything is working; now it looks so easy. Damn!</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Quoting myself:&nbsp;</span></div><div><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">“Highlight styles looks different on </strong><strong style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent;"><u><a href="https://highlightjs.org/demo" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Highlight demo</a></u></strong><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> than in Quill and it''s hard to find good style for HTML; better use Java for HTML XD</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">.</span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">” </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">I can’t handle this. I want good-looking code. Is it much? I don’t think so 😀</span></div><div class="ql-align-center"><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><img src="https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfFUIDoH9wBiX3utPIqvREuKUH7LJgGV3-BJ4YYHPkeyGMIXJ6wW9-LbGd8SSnqZ75TtM13y9ZDxgieyKEq1Bjvxsej4g-KRtvZA4xb20VYbH1rAU242poovLdjsQ3s-l-8x4LbCzNVtQrC-Ba_RbyE1Rc?key=wO4K5MSM86Dysxcd2z5kEg" height="291" width="602"></span></div><div class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"><img src="https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdbo176mu2Tr6nMPQjJNkqIR1hgbgkI9jMQi_zgA_J_bqeXd2rd7oYoH_QxRarlbfwnNzaVdMASSaGL15HdsDcg76ta1TkIywSJKQP3e0HUKsKbc-7ADzMVH6SuZyuaMXsqXHMGyH1bw-zDRQBjJbXYYfjL?key=wO4K5MSM86Dysxcd2z5kEg" height="407" width="602"></span></div><div class="ql-align-center"><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Honey on my eyes&nbsp;</strong></div><div class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"><img src="https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXckQQ2uqyA-EZjnjCzilpnUdyxv5WJ_26YzhxIhpdINR2Mf6y5hC89DBtPDGPoeht_Cizavy54wcXNerx9uKoQYkIO559HvGn26Eb3QC8vZCU4CPaCkhVdNaTe0-TTLmkeWFnQjBX0Eo6fa-08SOupLSdq0?key=wO4K5MSM86Dysxcd2z5kEg" height="601" width="602"></span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">What a pleasure!</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">I want to thank to SkyNet for helping me produce this meme and code:</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript">&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">onSubmit</span>(): <span class="hljs-built_in">void</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">highlightContent</span>();
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">valid</span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">apiService</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">addPost</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Post</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">highlightContent</span>(): <span class="hljs-built_in">void</span> {&nbsp;&nbsp;
	<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">controls</span>.<span class="hljs-property">content</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">setValue</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">extractAndHighlight</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">controls</span>.<span class="hljs-property">content</span>.<span class="hljs-property">value</span>));
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">extractAndHighlight</span>(<span class="hljs-attr">htmlContent</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">string</span>): <span class="hljs-built_in">string</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> tempDiv = <span class="hljs-variable language_">document</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">createElement</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''div''</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;tempDiv.<span class="hljs-property">innerHTML</span> = htmlContent;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> codeBlocks = tempDiv.<span class="hljs-title function_">querySelectorAll</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''pre''</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;codeBlocks.<span class="hljs-title function_">forEach</span>(<span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params">block</span>) =&gt;</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> language = block.<span class="hljs-title function_">getAttribute</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''data-language''</span>) || <span class="hljs-string">''plaintext''</span>;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> codeElement = <span class="hljs-variable language_">document</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">createElement</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''code''</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;codeElement.<span class="hljs-property">className</span> = language;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;codeElement.<span class="hljs-property">innerHTML</span> = hljs.<span class="hljs-title function_">highlight</span>(block.<span class="hljs-property">textContent</span> || <span class="hljs-string">''''</span>, { language }).<span class="hljs-property">value</span>;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;block.<span class="hljs-property">innerHTML</span> = <span class="hljs-string">''''</span>;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;block.<span class="hljs-title function_">appendChild</span>(codeElement);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;});
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> tempDiv.<span class="hljs-property">innerHTML</span>;
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">I think I spent more than a week on this. I think maybe 2. I asked a friend for help; thank you guys!&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">I see blogs, tutorials, etc. showing how easy people are doing hard things. I’m taking you on drive-through highway to hell 😣</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">I want to have alt to images, but not now, Please, it will be time when I say: </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Hit me baby one more time</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">.</span></div><h2 class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Protect unsaved data&nbsp;</span></h2><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Basically, now I’m writing my blog posts in google doc, then I copy to the admin editor and do styling. Is because:</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">I can accidentally close the window, navigate to some other page or refresh.</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">I can take a break and get back to writing after a few days.</span></div><h3 class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">HostListener</span></h3><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">This one will be easy</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-meta">@HostListener</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''window:beforeunload''</span>, [<span class="hljs-string">''$event''</span>])
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">handleBeforeUnload</span>(<span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-attr">event</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">BeforeUnloadEvent</span></span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;event.<span class="hljs-title function_">preventDefault</span>();
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
}
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">It will popup default information to the user so basically me. I’m very sad because I can’t hijack&nbsp;the before-unload</span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">event. It has been blocked since around 2016. Maybe you guys remember times when someone sent you a link, and in front you appeared a guy doing a helicopter with his sausage or some women shouting in ecstasy. Instantly, you get sweaty. At the speed of thunder, your hand automatically moves to the X button, but then... Plenty of popups appear, trying to close on; another comes in. I’m still fighting with PTSD with my therapist.&nbsp;</span></div><h3 class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Can Deactivate</span></h3><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">In this example, we can use our </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Dialog </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">component. So for now we can just display text, only components. But first off all, let’s create </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">CanDeactivateFn</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">.</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> <span class="hljs-attr">unsavedChangesGuard</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">CanDeactivateFn</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-title class_">AddPostComponent</span>&gt; = <span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-attr">component</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">AddPostComponent</span></span>) =&gt;</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> dynamicDialogService = <span class="hljs-title function_">inject</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">DynamicDialogService</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (component.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">dirty</span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> dynamicDialogService
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;.<span class="hljs-title function_">openDialog</span>(component.<span class="hljs-property">viewContainerRef</span>,
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">primaryButton</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''Yes''</span>,
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">secondaryButton</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''No''</span>,
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">title</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''You have unsaved changes''</span>,
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">content</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''Are you sure you want to leave this page?''</span>,
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;})
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;.<span class="hljs-title function_">pipe</span>(
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">map</span>(<span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params">status</span>) =&gt;</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (status === <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatusEnum</span>.<span class="hljs-property">ACCEPTED</span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;} <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;})
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;);
&nbsp;&nbsp;} <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">of</span>(<span class="hljs-literal">true</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
};
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Let adjust </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Dialog</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">.</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript">&nbsp;&nbsp;openDialog&lt;C <span class="hljs-keyword">extends</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Type</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-built_in">unknown</span>&gt;&gt;(<span class="hljs-attr">viewContainerRef</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">ViewContainerRef</span>, modalConfig?: <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalConfig</span>, component?: C): <span class="hljs-title class_">Subject</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatusEnum</span>&gt; {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">componentRef</span> =
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;viewContainerRef.<span class="hljs-title function_">createComponent</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">DynamicDialogComponent</span>, { <span class="hljs-attr">environmentInjector</span>: <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">envInjector</span> });
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (component) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">componentRef</span>.<span class="hljs-property">instance</span>.<span class="hljs-property">component</span> = component;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">componentRef</span>.<span class="hljs-property">instance</span>.<span class="hljs-property">modalConfig</span> = modalConfig;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">closeRef$</span>;
&nbsp;&nbsp;};
</code></pre><div><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Component</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> property will be last and optional.</span></div><div></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">DynamicDialogComponent</span>&lt;C = <span class="hljs-built_in">unknown</span>&gt; <span class="hljs-keyword">implements</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">OnInit</span>{
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-meta">@Input</span>() component?: <span class="hljs-title class_">Type</span>&lt;C&gt;;
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-meta">@Input</span>() modalConfig?: <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalConfig</span>;
&nbsp;&nbsp;divEl = viewChild.<span class="hljs-title function_">required</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''dynamicComponentContainer''</span>, {<span class="hljs-attr">read</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">ViewContainerRef</span>});
&nbsp;&nbsp;dynamicDialogService = <span class="hljs-title function_">inject</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">DynamicDialogService</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;viewContainerRef = <span class="hljs-title function_">inject</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">ViewContainerRef</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatusEnum</span> = <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatusEnum</span>;
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">ngOnInit</span>(): <span class="hljs-built_in">void</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">divEl</span>() &amp;&amp; <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">component</span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">divEl</span>().<span class="hljs-title function_">createComponent</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">component</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">closeDialog</span>(<span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-attr">status</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatusEnum</span></span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">dynamicDialogService</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">closeDialog</span>(status);
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
}
</code></pre><div><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Component </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">input here will also be optional, so we need to add an additional check in ngOninit(), if a component exists.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">In </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">HTML</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> file we just need to add:</span></div><pre data-language="xml"><code class="xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"mt-2"</span>&gt;</span>
  {{ modalConfig?.content || '''' }}
  <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">ng-template</span> #<span class="hljs-attr">dynamicComponentContainer</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">ng-template</span>&gt;</span>
<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span>
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Of Course</span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> content </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">property needs to be added to </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">ModalConfig</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">.</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">It doesn''t look perfect. </span></div><div class="ql-align-center"><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><img src="https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeWahm8w3sfn8R-vNizdCneEWGG09jqEhsLyCR-Wz7wu65FiisRr2BJYyQ27Ws-gaBXjzJfukpTv7q23DuvYp-kDCpp5ni0cPPWQwK5NSJMmsKi1Vs_yax2lYRJjDMRUYL-uj4xnyZsJDD9_oThAglBefE?key=wO4K5MSM86Dysxcd2z5kEg" height="211" width="602"></span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Let''s add some min-width to buttons, and min-height for modal.&nbsp;</span></div><div class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"><img src="https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcGOaEZJwjkhdokVse5u7_jH5sVkPzectaP_6jgnJx-Pw2JP4dM6VDD91BlSmHxbfAlkBBZ3tV-rwbHgdFn5T20dSlN8vtReMxImQMF9lkDpmiwR62ASQTI6Dx4IK0TiBzIorCvhbnf8dgMV4gFJUL-EtEU?key=wO4K5MSM86Dysxcd2z5kEg" height="293" width="602"></span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Much better.&nbsp;</span></div><h3 class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Save as a draft</span></h3><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">We need to extend our PostForm Interface:</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">interface</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">PostForm</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">title</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">FormControl</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-built_in">string</span>&gt;;
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">content</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">FormControl</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-built_in">string</span>&gt;;
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">isDraft</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">FormControl</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-built_in">boolean</span>&gt;;
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">date</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">FormControl</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-title class_">Date</span> | <span class="hljs-literal">null</span>&gt;;
&nbsp;&nbsp;description?: <span class="hljs-title class_">FormControl</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-built_in">string</span> | <span class="hljs-literal">null</span>&gt;;
}
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">add new button to form</span></div><pre data-language="xml"><code class="xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">button</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"btn btn--secondary"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">type</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"button"</span> (<span class="hljs-attr">click</span>)=<span class="hljs-string">"onSubmit(true)"</span>&gt;</span>Save as a draft<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">button</span>&gt;</span>
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">little bit adjust </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">submit</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> method:</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript">&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">onSubmit</span>(isDraft = <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>): <span class="hljs-built_in">void</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">highlightContent</span>();
