</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">We are creating an index simply, just clicking at the link that firebase provides for us, and wait 1-2 minutes.</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">As you already know I don’t like magic strings in my code. So I asked chat gpt to create num for me, based on the Post</span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">interface.</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"> <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> postsQuery = <span class="hljs-title function_">query</span>(
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">postsCollection</span>,
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">where</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">PostField</span>.<span class="hljs-property">IS_DRAFT</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">QueryOperators</span>.<span class="hljs-property">EQUAL</span>, <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>),
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">orderBy</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">PostField</span>.<span class="hljs-property">DATE</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">QueryOperators</span>.<span class="hljs-property">DESC</span>));
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Much better. In the future maybe we can write some generic function or some abstraction on it?</span></div><div class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"><img src="https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXf6wiWRdGspYOofdC4Dw6ph7wnnHGi3VJ459TCn3NurjKuD0XTRRokGYL8THlXJe1rqZ-aWttcgHwNOr4Rbj61N4ndGy4Dfdfu36ki20BjcY8ZHCuYa36CeyoU64GsbnmX_Pv47wuKmdIBxhgoirzCtwUc?key=wO4K5MSM86Dysxcd2z5kEg" height="457" width="602"></span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Much better!</span></div><h2 class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Edit post</span></h2><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Meanwhile I installed </span><u style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent;"><a href="https://daisyui.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">daisy ui</a></u><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">, which is a UI library for Tailwind.</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">For sure we will need additional route to handle editing, let’s edit </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">admin.routes.ts</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">:</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript">{
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">path</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'':postId''</span>,
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">component</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">AddPostComponent</span>,
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">canDeactivate</span>: [unsavedChangesGuard],
&nbsp;&nbsp;},
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">We will use </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">withComponentInputBinding()</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> to caught postId:&nbsp;</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-meta">@Input</span>() postId?: <span class="hljs-built_in">string</span>;
&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">ngOnInit</span>(): <span class="hljs-built_in">void</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">postId</span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">apiService</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">getPostById</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">postId</span>).<span class="hljs-title function_">subscribe</span>(<span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params">post</span>) =&gt;</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (post) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">patchValue</span>(post);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;});
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">onSubmit</span>(isDraft = <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>): <span class="hljs-built_in">void</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">highlightContent</span>();
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">valid</span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">controls</span>.<span class="hljs-property">isDraft</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">setValue</span>(isDraft);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">controls</span>.<span class="hljs-property">date</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">setValue</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Date</span>());
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">postId</span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">apiService</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">updatePost</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">postId</span>, <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Post</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;} <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">apiService</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">addPost</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Post</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">and in </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">AdminApiService</strong></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">updatePost</span>(<span class="hljs-attr">id</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">string</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">post</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">Post</span>): <span class="hljs-title class_">Promise</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-built_in">void</span>&gt; {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> postDoc = <span class="hljs-title function_">doc</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">firestore</span>, <span class="hljs-string">`<span class="hljs-subst">${Collections.POST}</span>/<span class="hljs-subst">${id}</span>`</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">updateDoc</span>(postDoc, { ...post });
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Not much, but how helpful!</span></div><h2 class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">fix headings and subheadings</span></h2><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Last, but not least. Tailwinds do not take care about headings, all have the same size, which doesn''t make any sense to me. In our styles.scss we need to add this lines:</span></div><pre data-language="css"><code class="css"><span class="hljs-selector-tag">h1</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">@apply</span> text-<span class="hljs-number">3</span>xl font-bold mt-<span class="hljs-number">2</span> mb-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>;
}
<span class="hljs-selector-tag">h2</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">@apply</span> text-<span class="hljs-number">2</span>xl font-bold mt-<span class="hljs-number">2</span> mb-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>;
}
<span class="hljs-selector-tag">h3</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">@apply</span> text-xl font-bold mt-<span class="hljs-number">2</span> mb-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>;
}
<span class="hljs-selector-tag">h4</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">@apply</span> text-lg font-bold mt-<span class="hljs-number">2</span> mb-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>;
}
<span class="hljs-selector-class">.tittle</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">@apply</span> text-<span class="hljs-number">4</span>xl font-bold my-<span class="hljs-number">2</span>;
}
</code></pre><h2 class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Errata</span></h2><h3 class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Dates</span></h3><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Date in </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">firebase</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> is stored as </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Timestamp</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">. So we need to adjust our </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Post</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> interface:</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-attr">date</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">Timestamp</span>;
&nbsp;&nbsp;dateJS?: <span class="hljs-title class_">Date</span>;
</code></pre><div><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">PostComponent</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">:</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript">&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">ngOnInit</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">index</span> = <span class="hljs-title class_">Number</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">index</span> +<span class="hljs-number">1</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">post$</span> = <span class="hljs-title function_">from</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">apiService</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">getPost</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">id</span>))
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;.<span class="hljs-title function_">pipe</span>(
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">map</span>(<span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-attr">post</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">Post</span> | <span class="hljs-literal">null</span></span>) =&gt;</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (post) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;post.<span class="hljs-property">dateJS</span> = post.<span class="hljs-property">date</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">toDate</span>();
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;post.<span class="hljs-property">content</span> = <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">sanitizer</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">bypassSecurityTrustHtml</span>(post.<span class="hljs-property">content</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">string</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> post;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;})
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">comments$</span>! = <span class="hljs-title function_">runInInjectionContext</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">injector</span>, <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">toSignal</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">apiService</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">getComments</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">id</span>)));
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
</code></pre><div><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">AddPostComponent</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">:</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title function_">onSubmit</span>(isDraft = <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>): <span class="hljs-built_in">void</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">highlightContent</span>();
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">valid</span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">controls</span>.<span class="hljs-property">isDraft</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">setValue</span>(isDraft);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">controls</span>.<span class="hljs-property">date</span>.<span class="hljs-property">value</span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">controls</span>.<span class="hljs-property">date</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">setValue</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">Timestamp</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">fromDate</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Date</span>()));
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">postId</span>) {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">apiService</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">updatePost</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">postId</span>, <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Post</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;} <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">apiService</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">addPost</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">blogForm</span>.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Post</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
&nbsp;&nbsp;}
</code></pre><div class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Add TypeScript to Quill code blocks</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">So, Quill by default has 14 languages to choose from but Typescript.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">In </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">quill-configuration.ts</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">, we just need to add few lines:</span></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">async</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">loadQuillModules</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>): <span class="hljs-title class_">Promise</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-built_in">void</span>&gt; {
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> [<span class="hljs-title class_">QuillModule</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">BlocKModule</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">SyntaxModule</span>] = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Promise</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">all</span>([
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''quill''</span>), <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''quill/blots/block''</span>), <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''quill/modules/syntax''</span>)
&nbsp;&nbsp;]);
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> supportedLanguages = [
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{ <span class="hljs-attr">key</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''xml''</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">label</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''XML''</span> },
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{ <span class="hljs-attr">key</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''typescript''</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">label</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''TypeScript''</span> },
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{ <span class="hljs-attr">key</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''javascript''</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">label</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''JavaScript''</span> },
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{ <span class="hljs-attr">key</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''css''</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">label</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''CSS''</span> },
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{ <span class="hljs-attr">key</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''plaintext''</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">label</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''Plain Text''</span> }
&nbsp;&nbsp;];
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title class_">BlocKModule</span>.<span class="hljs-property">default</span>.<span class="hljs-property">tagName</span> = <span class="hljs-string">"DIV"</span>;
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title class_">SyntaxModule</span>.<span class="hljs-property">default</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">register</span>();
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title class_">SyntaxModule</span>.<span class="hljs-property">default</span>.<span class="hljs-property">DEFAULTS</span>.<span class="hljs-property">languages</span> = supportedLanguages;
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title class_">QuillModule</span>.<span class="hljs-property">default</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">register</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">Block</span>, <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>);
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="hljs-title class_">QuillModule</span>.<span class="hljs-property">default</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">register</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">SyntaxModule</span>, <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>);
}
</code></pre><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">and that’s it!.</span></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Thanks for everything who read this 😀 It’s really fun for me, hope that for you too!&nbsp;</span></div>', false, '2024-08-13T18:48:50+00:00', 'https://aqdbdmepncxxuanlymwr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/covers/ChatGPT%20Image%2011%20sie%202026,%2020_53_29.png', '[]'::jsonb),
  ('6ec57e91-6d1a-4509-ad28-984cbed63d17', 'a3b3cf93-6956-41c7-bec0-13f95dd42f26', 'Super performant Blog app in Angular 18 with SSG and Hydration — Part 3.5: Dynamic Dialog & Quill Level UP', 'In this update, we enhanced Dynamic Dialog with generic types (T), making it more flexible for handling different data types. This allows smoother integration of forms and custom components.  We also added image insertion with alt text in Quill, improving SEO and accessibility. To boost performance, we optimized syntax highlighting, targeting only HTML, XML, and TypeScript blocks.  Finally, we fixed Firebase document size issues and improved Quill’s image handling, ensuring a smoother editing experience. Stay tuned for Part 4, where a major app refactor is coming! 🚀', '<h2 class="ql-align-center">Dynamic Dialog Level UP!!!</h2><div>Hello again. Welcome Back!</div><div>Currently I''m working on Part 4, which will be a big refactor of the application based on the book that I''ll introduce in the next chapter. During writing the next chapter, I wrote some scripts, to make screens as .webp and scripts that convert whole folder content into .webp. Great but when I tried to save as draft, part of next part, bump: firebase error. Firebase, can''t store images as .wbep. Wtf, Firestore xD</div><div>So what can be done? The first option is to upload images separately, and then link images, nooo too much work with posting. Second option: Create modal with image src and alt. But modal can''t support form callback, ups.</div><div>You always can ask—why don''t you use some library for that or even CDK? Because I don''t want to have in build what I don''t need, goal is to have as small a bundle as possible.</div><div></div><div><strong>Little errata, I''m writing this in about 80% of this post creation; the issue is not .webp as I was thinking. The issue is that Firestore can''t collect documents whose size is more than 1 MB. So yeah, the post is still current because it''ll also fix this error.</strong></div><div></div><h3 class="ql-align-center">Refactor model</h3><div>Let''s get started with model; we need to extend it a little bit.</div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">interface</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatus</span> {
  <span class="hljs-attr">status</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatusEnum</span>
}
<span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">enum</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatusEnum</span> {
  <span class="hljs-variable constant_">ACCEPTED</span> = <span class="hljs-string">''accepted''</span>,
  <span class="hljs-variable constant_">REJECTED</span> = <span class="hljs-string">''rejected''</span>,
  <span class="hljs-variable constant_">CLOSED</span> = <span class="hljs-string">''closed''</span>
}
</code></pre><div>to:</div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">interface</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatus</span>&lt;T = <span class="hljs-built_in">unknown</span>&gt; {
  <span class="hljs-attr">closeStatus</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalCloseStatusEnum</span>
  data?: T
}
<span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">enum</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalCloseStatusEnum</span> {
  <span class="hljs-variable constant_">ACCEPTED</span> = <span class="hljs-string">''accepted''</span>,
  <span class="hljs-variable constant_">REJECTED</span> = <span class="hljs-string">''rejected''</span>,
  <span class="hljs-variable constant_">CLOSED</span> = <span class="hljs-string">''closed''</span>
}
</code></pre><div></div><div></div><div>First of all, I extended data as a form: FromGroup&lt;T&gt;, but I asked myself, what if I want to return something else, maybe an object, an array, or a string? So I moved to data?: T. We also need to set type of T, ModalStatus&lt;T = unknown&gt;, because if we don''t, it will break parts of app that already implement ModalStatus.</div><div></div><h3 class="ql-align-center">Refactor Dynamic Dialog</h3><div>We''ll start form refactoring service:</div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-meta">@Injectable</span>({ <span class="hljs-attr">providedIn</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''root''</span> })
<span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">DynamicDialogService</span>&lt;T&gt; {

  <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> envInjector = <span class="hljs-title function_">inject</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">EnvironmentInjector</span>);
  <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> componentRef!: <span class="hljs-title class_">ComponentRef</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-title class_">DynamicDialogComponent</span>&gt;;
  <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> closeRef$ = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Subject</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatus</span>&lt;T&gt;&gt;();


  openDialog&lt;C&gt;(<span class="hljs-attr">viewContainerRef</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">ViewContainerRef</span>, modalConfig?: <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalConfig</span>, component?: <span class="hljs-title class_">Type</span>&lt;C&gt;)
    : <span class="hljs-title class_">Subject</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatus</span>&lt;T&gt;&gt; {
    <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">componentRef</span> =
      viewContainerRef.<span class="hljs-title function_">createComponent</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">DynamicDialogComponent</span>, { <span class="hljs-attr">environmentInjector</span>: <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">envInjector</span> });
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (component) {
      <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">componentRef</span>.<span class="hljs-property">instance</span>.<span class="hljs-property">component</span> = component;
    }
    <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">componentRef</span>.<span class="hljs-property">instance</span>.<span class="hljs-property">modalConfig</span> = modalConfig;
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">closeRef$</span>;
  };

  <span class="hljs-title function_">closeDialog</span>(<span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-attr">status</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatus</span>&lt;T&gt;</span>) {
    <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">componentRef</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">destroy</span>();
    <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">closeRef$</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">next</span>(status);
  };
}
</code></pre><div></div><div></div><div>As you can see, our service now adopt T, generic type. This will be our Data type. I regret that we can''t use openDialog&lt;C, T&gt; it would boost readability a looot. But we need (I hope just for now) service scooped variable - closeRef$.</div><div>We now can take a loot on this piece of code: envInjector = inject(EnvironmentInjector).</div><div>Why we need that? It''s just because services, don''t have own context, so we need to pass context from component in which we calls our Dynamic Dialog.</div><div>If you want to know more, you can jump here; it''s fully explained here: <a href="https://angularexperts.io/blog/angular-template-context" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Angular Context</a>.</div><div></div><div>That''s how Dynamic Dialog Component looks like:</div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { <span class="hljs-title class_">ChangeDetectionStrategy</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">Component</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">ComponentRef</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">Input</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">OnInit</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">Type</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">ViewContainerRef</span>, inject, viewChild } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">''@angular/core''</span>;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { <span class="hljs-title class_">DynamicDialogService</span> } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">''./dynamic-dialog.service''</span>;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalConfig</span> } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">''../_models/modal-config.intreface''</span>;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalCloseStatusEnum</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatus</span> } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">''../_models/modal-status.interface''</span>;

<span class="hljs-meta">@Component</span>({
  <span class="hljs-attr">selector</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''app-dynamic-dialog''</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">standalone</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">imports</span>: [],
  <span class="hljs-attr">providers</span>: [],
  <span class="hljs-attr">templateUrl</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''./dynamic-dialog.component.html''</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">styleUrl</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''./dynamic-dialog.component.scss''</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">changeDetection</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">ChangeDetectionStrategy</span>.<span class="hljs-property">OnPush</span>
})
<span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">DynamicDialogComponent</span>&lt;C = <span class="hljs-built_in">unknown</span>&gt; <span class="hljs-keyword">implements</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">OnInit</span> {
  <span class="hljs-meta">@Input</span>() component?: <span class="hljs-title class_">Type</span>&lt;C&gt;;
  <span class="hljs-meta">@Input</span>() modalConfig?: <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalConfig</span>;

  divEl = viewChild.<span class="hljs-title function_">required</span>(<span class="hljs-string">''dynamicComponentContainer''</span>, { <span class="hljs-attr">read</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">ViewContainerRef</span> });

  dynamicDialogService = <span class="hljs-title function_">inject</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">DynamicDialogService</span>);
  viewContainerRef = <span class="hljs-title function_">inject</span>(<span class="hljs-title class_">ViewContainerRef</span>);
  componentRef?: <span class="hljs-title class_">ComponentRef</span>&lt;C&gt;;
  <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalCloseStatusEnum</span> = <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalCloseStatusEnum</span>;

  <span class="hljs-title function_">ngOnInit</span>(): <span class="hljs-built_in">void</span> {
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">divEl</span>() &amp;&amp; <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">component</span>) {
      <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">componentRef</span> = <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">divEl</span>().<span class="hljs-title function_">createComponent</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">component</span>);
    }
  }

  <span class="hljs-title function_">closeDialog</span>(<span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-attr">modalCloseStatus</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalCloseStatusEnum</span></span>) {
    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> status = {
      <span class="hljs-attr">data</span>: <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">componentRef</span>?.<span class="hljs-property">instance</span>,
      <span class="hljs-attr">closeStatus</span>: modalCloseStatus
    } <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">ModalStatus</span>;

    <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">dynamicDialogService</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">closeDialog</span>(status);
  }

}
</code></pre><div></div><div>Of course we refactored <strong>ModalStatus.</strong></div><div>We also introduced new variable - <strong>componentRef?: ComponentRef&lt;C&gt;</strong>. So now we have access to a dynamically created component, inside it is an instance that holds out <strong>data&lt;T&gt;</strong>.</div><div>What''s given us? Now we can do more generic UI components.</div><div></div><h2 class="ql-align-center"></h2><h2 class="ql-align-center">Insert &lt;img&gt; tag with alt in Quill</h2><h3 class="ql-align-center">Add-Image Component</h3><div>This refactor above was needed to implement this logic.</div><pre data-language="plain">ng g c -c OnPush add-image
</pre><div>Also, we need: <strong>add-image-controls.interface.ts: </strong></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { <span class="hljs-title class_">FormControl</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">FormGroup</span> } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">"@angular/forms"</span>;

