</code></pre><div></div><div></div><div>We need to define controls, and also form, because it will be our <strong>data&lt;T&gt;</strong>. And you component implements simple form:</div><div></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="typescript"><span class="hljs-meta">@Component</span>({
